00:56:41,398 --> 00:56:43,150
I can't see how
they figured out who built it.

1028
00:56:43,233 --> 00:56:45,652
That information
is highly classified.

1029
00:56:46,445 --> 00:56:48,030
(DEVICE CHIMES SOFTLY)

1030
00:56:48,906 --> 00:56:49,907
What is that?

1031
00:56:49,990 --> 00:56:51,408
-That's a new ringtone?
-Oh, shit.

1032
00:56:52,743 --> 00:56:54,828
Uh, Director, I'm sorry.
I'm gonna have to take this.

1033
00:56:54,912 --> 00:56:56,121
It's enough
with the titles.

1034
00:56:56,204 --> 00:56:57,372
Just take it. I don't care.

1035
00:56:57,456 --> 00:56:58,665
Hey, honey sweetheart.

1036
00:56:58,749 --> 00:57:00,375
Ooh. (CHUCKLES)

1037
00:57:00,459 --> 00:57:03,003
Uh, no, I'm...
I'm with my boss. Now.

1038
00:57:03,712 --> 00:57:05,088
Actually, she's leaving.

1039
00:57:05,255 --> 00:57:06,256
All right.

1040
00:57:06,423 --> 00:57:08,884
I'm gonna work from home,
and then have a shower.

1041
00:57:11,094 --> 00:57:12,095
(CAR STARTS)

1042
00:57:14,598 --> 00:57:16,183
(KIMOYO BEADS CHIRP)

1043
00:57:16,266 --> 00:57:17,768
Everett Ross.

1044
00:57:17,935 --> 00:57:19,061
Queen Ramonda?

1045
00:57:19,227 --> 00:57:21,188
What are you doing
with Shuri's Kimoyo Beads?

1046
00:57:21,271 --> 00:57:23,231
I didn't know they were hers.
All right?

1047
00:57:23,315 --> 00:57:25,567
I just found them
at a pretty ugly crime scene.

1048
00:57:26,610 --> 00:57:27,736
Do you have the student?

1049
00:57:28,612 --> 00:57:31,573
Shuri was trying to save her
when they were both taken.

1050
00:57:32,491 --> 00:57:33,951
What? Taken by who?

1051
00:57:35,535 --> 00:57:37,579
My agency assumes it was you.

1052
00:57:37,663 --> 00:57:39,706
And I'm worried
they might be onto the fact

1053
00:57:39,790 --> 00:57:42,042
that I pointed Shuri and Okoye
in the right direction.

1054
00:57:42,209 --> 00:57:43,919
Look, if they're in danger,
I wanna help.

1055
00:57:44,002 --> 00:57:45,921
But I can't if I don't know
what's going on.

1056
00:57:46,088 --> 00:57:48,799
I am afraid there is
a new world power at play.

1057
00:57:49,216 --> 00:57:51,176
A country
that's already on our radar?

1058
00:57:51,259 --> 00:57:52,260
Or you mean someone else?

1059
00:57:52,344 --> 00:57:54,346
RAMONDA: That is all I can say for now.

1060
00:57:54,513 --> 00:57:55,514
Please,

1061
00:57:55,931 --> 00:57:58,600
alert me if your government
decides to act

1062
00:57:58,684 --> 00:58:00,268
on their suspicions.

1063
00:58:00,352 --> 00:58:01,520
Yeah. Sure.

1064
00:58:02,104 --> 00:58:06,108
Uh, look, if there's anything
I can do to help, let me know.

1065
00:58:06,274 --> 00:58:08,068
I owe Shuri my life.

1066
00:58:08,819 --> 00:58:12,739
GRIOT, did Shuri have
her earrings with her?

1067
00:58:12,906 --> 00:58:15,450
GRIOT: / lost track of them
in the North Atlantic,

1068
00:58:15,617 --> 00:58:18,787
but the people who took her
spoke Yucatec Mayan.

1069
00:58:28,922 --> 00:58:29,923
(RAMONDA SPEAKING
HAITIAN CREOLE)

1070
00:59:07,044 --> 00:59:08,920
-Hmm?
-GIRL 1: Oui, Miss Nakia.

1071
00:59:11,506 --> 00:59:12,507
(GIRL 1 SPEAKING)

1072
00:59:12,591 --> 00:59:13,592
(GIRL 2 SPEAKING)

1073
00:59:19,389 --> 00:59:20,640
(IN ENGLISH) Queen Mother.

1074
00:59:22,476 --> 00:59:24,770
Everything is a lesson here
for the children.

1075
00:59:24,936 --> 00:59:27,939
They painted the walls,
they feed the fish,

1076
00:59:28,106 --> 00:59:30,400
and they grow
everything we eat here.

1077
00:59:30,567 --> 00:59:33,195
I recognize
some of the concepts here.

1078
00:59:33,361 --> 00:59:35,322
But you are using
different material.

1079
00:59:35,489 --> 00:59:38,825
Yes, we use strictly what
we can find here in Haiti.

1080
00:59:40,827 --> 00:59:44,164
You were missed
at T'Challa's funeral.

1081
00:59:47,292 --> 00:59:48,293
Oh...

1082
00:59:55,926 --> 00:59:57,135
(QUIETLY) Queen Mother.

1083
00:59:57,302 --> 01:00:00,263
RAMONDA.: It's been six years
since you left us.

1084
01:00:00,430 --> 01:00:03,600
I thought you would at least
come back for the ceremony.

1085
01:00:06,353 --> 01:00:07,854
I was afraid

1086
01:00:08,730 --> 01:00:12,526
of how final
the funeral would be.

1087
01:00:12,609 --> 01:00:15,654
Nakia, daughter of Yaa,

1088
01:00:16,947 --> 01:00:20,826
wherever you go,
you are still Wakandan,

1089
01:00:20,992 --> 01:00:24,621
and you know
death is not the end.

1090
01:00:29,709 --> 01:00:31,002
(IN XHOSA)

1091
01:00:35,757 --> 01:00:37,509
(IN ENGLISH)
How is everyone at home?

1092
01:00:37,676 --> 01:00:40,011
Shuri has been taken.

1093
01:00:40,720 --> 01:00:41,721
What?

1094
01:00:42,139 --> 01:00:45,142
You have infiltrated
many nations before.

1095
01:00:45,559 --> 01:00:46,852
(IN XHOSA)

1096
01:00:47,561 --> 01:00:48,895
(IN ENGLISH)
I was a different person then.

1097
01:00:48,979 --> 01:00:52,023
I need someone who can find
where she is being held,

1098
01:00:52,190 --> 01:00:55,235
and rescue her,
without being seen.

1099
01:00:55,610 --> 01:00:58,446
Who on earth would risk war
with Wakanda?

1100
01:01:00,824 --> 01:01:01,908
RIRI: Oh, my God. (GASPING)

1101
01:01:01,992 --> 01:01:03,285
SHURI: Okay, breathe. Breathe.

1102
01:01:03,368 --> 01:01:04,828
Oh, don't tell me to breathe.

1103
01:01:04,995 --> 01:01:05,996
Where the hell are we?

1104
01:01:06,163 --> 01:01:08,290
We're in a cave.
I'm not sure where.

1105
01:01:08,373 --> 01:01:09,374
Oh, my God!

1106
01:01:09,916 --> 01:01:11,501
(GASPS) What is that?

1107
01:01:11,668 --> 01:01:14,421
SHURI: Glow worms.
Their larva gives off light.

1108
01:01:14,504 --> 01:01:16,423
-(RIRI GASPS HEAVILY)
-SHURI: Just calm down.

1109
01:01:16,840 --> 01:01:18,717
Okay, is there, like,
a new Black Panther

1110
01:01:18,800 --> 01:01:20,051
that you can call
to come and get us?

1111
01:01:20,135 --> 01:01:21,136
No.

1112
01:01:21,219 --> 01:01:22,220
Why not?

1113
01:01:22,304 --> 01:01:24,097
Because it doesn't
work like that anymore.

1114
01:01:24,848 --> 01:01:26,433
The Black Panther is gone.

1115
01:01:27,100 --> 01:01:28,185
So y'all stopped
having Black Panthers

1116
01:01:28,268 --> 01:01:29,269
when I get kidnapped?

1117
01:01:29,769 --> 01:01:31,771
(MYSTERIOUS MUSIC PLAYS)

1118
01:01:34,774 --> 01:01:35,775
(IN MAYAN)

1119
01:01:42,365 --> 01:01:44,534
(IN ENGLISH)
Do you understand her?

1120
01:01:44,701 --> 01:01:46,203
Not completely.

1121
01:01:48,288 --> 01:01:49,497
Nuh-uh.

1122
01:01:49,664 --> 01:01:52,000
That is some supervillain shit
right there.

1123
01:01:52,167 --> 01:01:53,501
That's in every movie.

1124
01:01:53,668 --> 01:01:54,920
Princess Leia.

1125
01:01:55,086 --> 01:01:56,338
Belle from
Beauty and the Beast.

1126
01:01:56,421 --> 01:01:59,049
That white chick
from Indiana Jones.

1127
01:01:59,132 --> 01:02:00,258
It's fine.

1128
01:02:00,342 --> 01:02:02,886
You should see what I have
to wear at Warrior Falls.

1129
01:02:03,803 --> 01:02:05,972
(MYSTERIOUS MUSIC CONTINUES)

1130
01:02:09,309 --> 01:02:10,310
(IN MAYAN)

1131
01:02:11,311 --> 01:02:12,729
(IN ENGLISH, HESITATES) Wait.

1132
01:02:12,812 --> 01:02:15,273
You're not leaving me in here,
are you?

1133
01:02:15,357 --> 01:02:16,816
I'm coming back.

1134
01:02:17,484 --> 01:02:18,693
I'm coming back.

1135
01:02:18,860 --> 01:02:20,779
Stay calm.

1136
01:02:28,161 --> 01:02:29,162
(IN MAYAN)

1137
01:02:30,914 --> 01:02:31,998
(CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

1138
01:02:33,416 --> 01:02:35,168
(CRYPTIC MUSIC PLAYING)

1139
01:02:38,171 --> 01:02:39,965
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

1140
01:02:40,757 --> 01:02:42,175
(GOATS BLEATING)

1141
01:02:43,343 --> 01:02:45,053
(IN SPANISH)

1142
01:03:14,833 --> 01:03:15,875
(IN MAYAN)

1143
01:03:17,585 --> 01:03:19,838
(CRYPTIC MUSIC CONTINUES)

1144
01:03:28,513 --> 01:03:30,015
(IN SPANISH)

1145
01:04:10,847 --> 01:04:12,807
(EERIE MUSIC PLAYING)

1146
01:04:29,824 --> 01:04:31,451
(IN ENGLISH) Princess.

1147
01:04:31,618 --> 01:04:32,619
Welcome.

1148
01:04:34,579 --> 01:04:37,040
Please, feel free.

1149
01:04:44,297 --> 01:04:45,590
This is beautiful.

1150
01:04:46,424 --> 01:04:48,176
That was my mother's.

1151
01:04:58,228 --> 01:05:00,772
These are all
Mesoamerican artifacts.

1152
01:05:02,232 --> 01:05:04,109
Most likely 16th century.

1153
01:05:05,318 --> 01:05:07,529
Have you been alive
since then?

1154
01:05:09,489 --> 01:05:11,032
Your mother was human.

1155
01:05:12,492 --> 01:05:13,493
She was.

1156
01:05:13,660 --> 01:05:15,870
Then she became
something else.

1157
01:05:16,037 --> 01:05:18,081
-How?
-"How?"

1158
01:05:18,665 --> 01:05:21,126
"How" is never
as important as "why."

1159
01:05:30,301 --> 01:05:32,303
(EERIE MUSIC CONTINUES)

1160
01:05:32,387 --> 01:05:33,847
NAMOR: My mother
and her village

1161
01:05:33,930 --> 01:05:35,515
were driven from their farms

1162
01:05:35,682 --> 01:05:39,436
by Spanish conquistadors
who brought the smallpox,

1163
01:05:39,602 --> 01:05:42,480
a hateful language,
and dogma from another world.

1164
01:05:44,274 --> 01:05:45,984
Facing starvation,

1165
01:05:46,151 --> 01:05:47,986
war, and disease,

1166
01:05:48,445 --> 01:05:50,238
my people turned to Chaac...

1167
01:05:51,906 --> 01:05:53,783
our god of rain and abundance.

1168
01:05:55,994 --> 01:05:58,830
Chaac gave our shaman
a vision...

1169
01:05:58,913 --> 01:06:01,583
-(GASPS)
-...a way to save his people.

1170
01:06:01,666 --> 01:06:03,918
(ARBOLES BAJO EL MAR PLAYING)

1171
01:06:05,587 --> 01:06:09,966
NAMOR: Chaac led him to a plant
sprouting from a blue rock.

1172
01:06:23,438 --> 01:06:25,648
My mother was pregnant with me
at the time,

1173
01:06:25,815 --> 01:06:28,067
and she did not want to
ingest the plant

1174
01:06:28,234 --> 01:06:30,445
for fear
of what it may do to me.

1175
01:06:30,945 --> 01:06:32,113
(IN MAYAN)

1176
01:06:32,614 --> 01:06:34,491
(IN ENGLISH)
But the Shaman was convincing.

1177
01:06:43,082 --> 01:06:45,001
(SHAMAN SPEAKING MAYAN)

1178
01:07:00,183 --> 01:07:02,727
(ARBOLES BAJO EL MAR
CONTINUES)

1179
01:07:06,356 --> 01:07:08,191
NAMOR: (IN ENGLISH)
They all fell sick.

1180
01:07:08,274 --> 01:07:09,275
(BODY THUDS)

1181
01:07:09,359 --> 01:07:11,194
And their lives,

1182
01:07:11,361 --> 01:07:13,488
their existence there,

1183
01:07:13,655 --> 01:07:14,948
ended.

1184
01:07:18,117 --> 01:07:20,495
(ALL GASPING FOR BREATH)

1185
01:07:26,834 --> 01:07:29,087
The plant took away
their ability to breathe air

1186
01:07:29,254 --> 01:07:33,049
but enabled them
to draw oxygen from the sea.

1187
01:07:36,386 --> 01:07:38,137
They settled in the ocean,

1188
01:07:38,805 --> 01:07:41,933
away from war and diseases.

1189
01:07:44,519 --> 01:07:45,603
(SHAMAN SPEAKING MAYAN)

1190
01:07:45,687 --> 01:07:46,729
(SHAMAN GRUNTS)

1191
01:07:50,024 --> 01:07:52,068
(EERIE MUSIC CONTINUES)

1192
01:07:58,366 --> 01:08:00,785
(WOMAN WHISPERING BLESSING
IN SPANISH)

1193
01:08:01,703 --> 01:08:03,121
(RITUALISTIC RHYTHMIC BLOWING)

1194
01:08:11,087 --> 01:08:13,256
(IN ENGLISH) My mother
gave birth to me there

1195
01:08:13,548 --> 01:08:16,801
and I became
the firstborn son of Talokan.

1196
01:08:17,260 --> 01:08:19,345
The plant gave me wings
on my ankles

1197
01:08:19,512 --> 01:08:21,931
and ears
that pointed to the clouds.

1198
01:08:22,390 --> 01:08:23,641
I was a mutant.

1199
01:08:24,559 --> 01:08:27,812
I could swim in the sky
and age slower.

1200
01:08:27,979 --> 01:08:30,481
Breathe the air
our ancestors breathed.

1201
01:08:31,733 --> 01:08:33,318
As she grew older,

1202
01:08:34,652 --> 01:08:38,239
my mother mourned the life
on land that she once knew...

1203
01:08:40,158 --> 01:08:41,909
and died with a broken heart.

1204
01:08:44,662 --> 01:08:46,289
She made me promise

1205
01:08:46,372 --> 01:08:48,625
to bury her
in the soil of her homeland.

1206
01:08:53,755 --> 01:08:56,674
Nothing could prepare me
for what I found there.

1207
01:08:56,758 --> 01:08:58,551
-(MEN SHOUTING)
-(WHIPS LASHING)

1208
01:08:58,635 --> 01:09:00,345
(SLAVES GROANING)

1209
01:09:00,428 --> 01:09:02,055
-(MAN SHOUTS IN SPANISH)
-(WOMAN GROANS)

1210
01:09:04,057 --> 01:09:05,141
(IN SPANISH)

1211
01:09:06,309 --> 01:09:07,310
Huh?

1212
01:09:07,935 --> 01:09:10,104
(EERIE MUSIC PLAYING)

1213
01:09:18,446 --> 01:09:20,281
(MUSIC SOURS)

1214
01:09:24,619 --> 01:09:25,787
(MEN SHOUTING)

1215
01:09:25,870 --> 01:09:27,872
(PANICKED SCREAMING)

1216
01:09:39,467 --> 01:09:40,468
(FRIAR SPEAKING)

1217
01:09:43,012 --> 01:09:45,014
(IN ENGLISH) A Spanish man
of faith cursed me.

1218
01:09:45,181 --> 01:09:47,058
As he died by my hand,

1219
01:09:47,225 --> 01:09:48,267
he called me...

1220
01:09:48,476 --> 01:09:49,644
(IN SPANISH)

1221
01:09:51,729 --> 01:09:52,897
(CHUCKLES)

1222
01:09:53,690 --> 01:09:55,900
(IN ENGLISH)
The child without love.

1223
01:09:56,442 --> 01:09:57,902
And I took my name from there.

1224
01:10:03,282 --> 01:10:04,992
""Namor."

1225
01:10:05,159 --> 01:10:07,995
Because I have no love
for the surface world.

1226
01:10:09,997 --> 01:10:12,083
Why are you telling me
all of this?

1227
01:10:13,501 --> 01:10:16,629
So that you can understand why
I have to kill the scientist.

1228
01:10:16,796 --> 01:10:18,381
What if we took her
to Wakanda?

1229
01:10:19,757 --> 01:10:20,967
Let us go.

1230
01:10:21,926 --> 01:10:23,386
I give you my word.

1231
01:10:23,553 --> 01:10:25,012
She will remain in my country.

1232
01:10:25,221 --> 01:10:26,681
I cannot risk that, Princess.

1233
01:10:26,848 --> 01:10:28,474
Then keep me instead.

1234
01:10:30,435 --> 01:10:32,061
I'd love to see your nation.

1235
01:10:33,396 --> 01:10:36,023
Well, you can't go
down there in that.

1236
01:10:38,067 --> 01:10:41,529
Hypothermia will grip you
almost instantaneously.

1237
01:10:41,696 --> 01:10:43,948
Your blood will become toxic

1238
01:10:44,031 --> 01:10:45,450
and the pressure of the ocean

1239
01:10:45,533 --> 01:10:47,952
will break every bone
in your body.

1240
01:10:51,038 --> 01:10:52,290
(IN LIGHT TONE)
Or you can wear a suit.

1241
01:10:52,707 --> 01:10:54,459
We have some of them. Come on.

1242
01:10:57,545 --> 01:10:58,546
Stay close.

1243
01:11:01,174 --> 01:11:03,384
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

1244
01:11:51,891 --> 01:11:52,892
(YELPS)

1245
01:12:02,902 --> 01:12:04,570
SHURI: Hey! Namor, wait!

1246
01:12:25,216 --> 01:12:26,884
(BREATHING HEAVILY)

1247
01:12:40,064 --> 01:12:42,275
(WHALE SINGING)

1248
01:12:43,150 --> 01:12:45,319
(SOFT MUSIC INTRO PLAYING)

1249
01:12:49,615 --> 01:12:50,741
SHURI: Whoa!

1250
01:12:52,493 --> 01:12:54,871
(CON LA BRISA BY FOUDEQUSH
PLAYING)

1251
01:12:58,416 --> 01:12:59,792
(GASPING IN AWE)

1252
01:13:35,244 --> 01:13:37,580
(CON LA BRISA BY FOUDEQUSH
CONTINUES)

1253
01:14:08,152 --> 01:14:09,612
Hello.

1254
01:14:15,117 --> 01:14:17,411
(CON LA BRISA BY FOUDEQUSH
CONTINUES)

1255
01:14:38,182 --> 01:14:39,308
It's beautiful.

1256
01:14:41,143 --> 01:14:42,478
It's made of vibranium.

1257
01:14:42,645 --> 01:14:43,646
NAMOR: Yes.

1258
01:14:43,729 --> 01:14:45,314
In the depths of the ocean,

1259
01:14:45,731 --> 01:14:47,984
I brought the sun
to my people.

1260
01:14:50,069 --> 01:14:51,195
I know you wished me

1261
01:14:51,278 --> 01:14:53,531
to spare the life
of the scientist.

1262
01:14:53,906 --> 01:14:56,158
But now you see
what I have to protect.

1263
01:14:58,077 --> 01:15:00,454
(CON LA BRISA BY FOUDEQUSH
CONTINUES)

1264
01:15:19,724 --> 01:15:20,891
(KIMOYO BEADS CHIRP)

1265
01:15:20,975 --> 01:15:23,060
GRIOT: (ON COMMS) Nakia,
your hunch was correct.

1266
01:15:23,227 --> 01:15:26,230
I have picked up a location
on Shuri's Kimoyo earrings.

1267
01:15:30,901 --> 01:15:33,112
(MYSTERIOUS MUSIC PLAYING)

1268
01:15:48,210 --> 01:15:49,420
(ENGINE HUMMING)

1269
01:15:59,597 --> 01:16:02,224
GRIOT: The signal is coming
from an underwater cavern

1270
01:16:02,391 --> 01:16:05,853
approximately 140 meters
below the surface.

1271
01:16:06,479 --> 01:16:08,773
Queen Mother,
I've found her signal.

1272
01:16:08,939 --> 01:16:11,067
It's coming
from an underwater cave.

1273
01:16:12,068 --> 01:16:13,069
If she's down there,

1274
01:16:13,152 --> 01:16:14,779
I'm sure
I'll encounter resistance.

1275
01:16:15,738 --> 01:16:17,656
How would you like me
to proceed?

1276
01:16:18,574 --> 01:16:22,953
Retrieve the princess
by any means necessary.

1277
01:16:23,120 --> 01:16:26,332
I will attempt
to draw Namor out.

1278
01:16:34,757 --> 01:16:36,509
(BREATHES DEEPLY)

1279
01:16:40,387 --> 01:16:42,389
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

1280
01:17:01,242 --> 01:17:02,910
You are the first person
from the surface

1281
01:17:02,993 --> 01:17:04,495
to come to Talokan.

1282
01:17:05,496 --> 01:17:07,540
Please take this as a token
of our gratitude.

1283
01:17:14,713 --> 01:17:17,299
It was made with the plant
that saved Talokan.

1284
01:17:20,094 --> 01:17:21,470
You are young, Princess.

1285
01:17:22,346 --> 01:17:25,266
When you age as I do,
you realize

1286
01:17:25,432 --> 01:17:28,185
we all lose everyone we love.

1287
01:17:28,352 --> 01:17:29,937
But when I lost my brother,

1288
01:17:30,104 --> 01:17:31,730
it just felt different.

1289
01:17:31,897 --> 01:17:33,566
He suffered in silence.

1290
01:17:34,150 --> 01:17:37,153
When he finally asked me
to help him, I couldn't.

1291
01:17:38,237 --> 01:17:39,947
How does that make sense

1292
01:17:40,906 --> 01:17:44,577
that the ancestors would
give me gifts and skills

1293
01:17:44,743 --> 01:17:47,496
to help me save my brother,
and I couldn't?

1294
01:17:48,998 --> 01:17:49,999
Why?

1295
01:17:52,459 --> 01:17:54,962
I don't have an answer
for that question.

1296
01:17:57,089 --> 01:17:59,633
My ancestors would often say,

1297
01:18:00,009 --> 01:18:03,429
"Only the most broken people
can be great leaders."

1298
01:18:07,183 --> 01:18:09,351
I admire
what you have built here.

1299
01:18:11,645 --> 01:18:14,106
And how you've protected
your people.

1300
01:18:14,899 --> 01:18:17,943
But as princess of Wakanda,

1301
01:18:18,110 --> 01:18:20,571
I will not stand for you
killing that young woman.

1302
01:18:22,281 --> 01:18:25,367
My nation will not rest
until I'm returned.

1303
01:18:26,785 --> 01:18:28,913
I'm not leaving without her.

1304
01:18:29,663 --> 01:18:33,375
We need to find a peaceful way
to resolve this.

1305
01:18:37,046 --> 01:18:38,756
It is no longer
about the scientist.

1306
01:18:40,841 --> 01:18:42,468
For centuries,
the surface nations

1307
01:18:42,551 --> 01:18:45,346
have conquered and enslaved
people like us.

1308
01:18:46,013 --> 01:18:47,473
Over resources.

1309
01:18:48,891 --> 01:18:51,143
Since the day
I buried my mother,

1310
01:18:51,310 --> 01:18:52,937
I have prepared my people

1311
01:18:53,020 --> 01:18:55,147
for the time
they will come for us.

1312
01:18:55,314 --> 01:18:59,526
And that machine is the sign
that the time is now.

1313
01:19:01,403 --> 01:19:06,742
I need to know if Wakanda
is an ally or an enemy.

1314
01:19:07,159 --> 01:19:09,036
There is no in-between.

1315
01:19:11,163 --> 01:19:14,875
So you plan to wage war
on the entire world,

1316
01:19:15,459 --> 01:19:17,795
and you want Wakanda
to help you?

1317
01:19:18,712 --> 01:19:19,880
That's madness.

1318
01:19:20,047 --> 01:19:23,050
There isn't a nation
that wouldn't plunder Wakanda

1319
01:19:23,133 --> 01:19:24,677
if given a chance.

1320
01:19:26,011 --> 01:19:27,930
If we make an alliance,

1321
01:19:28,097 --> 01:19:30,808
we can protect each other
by striking them first.

1322
01:19:31,350 --> 01:19:35,604
Then, when the threat of these
nations has been eliminated,

1323
01:19:35,771 --> 01:19:38,399
the scientist will be returned
to Wakanda.

1324
01:19:38,816 --> 01:19:41,610
And if Wakanda
does not accept, what then?

1325
01:19:42,695 --> 01:19:44,655
The scientist will die.

1326
01:19:45,656 --> 01:19:48,575
And Wakanda will be
the first nation to fall.

1327
01:19:48,826 --> 01:19:50,369
An attack on my people?

1328
01:19:50,703 --> 01:19:52,162
Yes.

1329
01:19:52,329 --> 01:19:54,707
And I want you
to listen to me.

1330
01:19:54,873 --> 01:19:57,835
Wakanda cannot win a war
with Talokan.

1331
01:19:59,962 --> 01:20:01,839
(WATER SLOSHES)

1332
01:20:01,922 --> 01:20:03,215
(IN MAYAN)

1333
01:20:09,680 --> 01:20:11,890
(IN ENGLISH)
I heard you that night,

1334
01:20:11,974 --> 01:20:13,976
with your mother at the river.

1335
01:20:15,269 --> 01:20:18,022
You said you wanted
to burn the world.

1336
01:20:24,194 --> 01:20:25,696
Let us burn it together.

1337
01:20:29,950 --> 01:20:31,493
(WATER SLOSHING)

1338
01:20:34,330 --> 01:20:35,497
US SECRETARY OF STATE:
Queen Ramonda

1339
01:20:35,581 --> 01:20:37,249
won't sell us any vibranium.

1340
01:20:38,000 --> 01:20:39,543
And now they abducted
a young woman

1341
01:20:39,626 --> 01:20:40,878
who built the machine.

1342
01:20:41,045 --> 01:20:42,338
Yeah, with all due respect,

1343
01:20:42,421 --> 01:20:44,048
Riri Williams
is a child prodigy

1344
01:20:44,131 --> 01:20:46,342
who was running circles around
all of her professors.

1345
01:20:46,508 --> 01:20:47,968
The Wakandans
were recruiting her

1346
01:20:48,052 --> 01:20:49,386
as part of their
outreach program.

1347
01:20:49,553 --> 01:20:50,971
Nothing more. And then,

1348
01:20:51,138 --> 01:20:53,515
you guys send ina SWAT team
under cover of night

1349
01:20:53,682 --> 01:20:55,684
to arrest the Crown Princess

1350
01:20:55,768 --> 01:20:57,102
of an international
superpower.

1351
01:21:00,272 --> 01:21:01,940
The President wants
to take offensive action

1352
01:21:02,024 --> 01:21:03,067
against Wakanda.

1353
01:21:03,150 --> 01:21:04,401
(CRYPTIC MUSIC PLAYS)

1354
01:21:04,485 --> 01:21:06,362
What type of offensive action?

1355
01:21:07,071 --> 01:21:08,614
Destabilization.

1356
01:21:09,782 --> 01:21:13,118
Well, Special Officer Ross
is our expert.

1357
01:21:13,285 --> 01:21:15,496
So, Ross, what do you think?

1358
01:21:15,662 --> 01:21:17,164
My sources are telling me

1359
01:21:17,247 --> 01:21:18,457
that there's someone else
out there.

1360
01:21:19,375 --> 01:21:21,293
-Another nation?
-ROSS: Could be. I don't know.

1361
01:21:21,377 --> 01:21:22,378
You've gotta give me
enough time

1362
01:21:22,461 --> 01:21:23,545
to investigate this properly,

1363
01:21:23,629 --> 01:21:25,756
otherwise we're gonna
find ourselves at war

1364
01:21:25,923 --> 01:21:27,758
with a country
whose military capacity

1365
01:21:27,841 --> 01:21:29,802
we can't even comprehend.

1366
01:21:31,387 --> 01:21:32,388
Director?

1367
01:21:32,846 --> 01:21:35,099
I think he's the expert.

1368
01:21:35,182 --> 01:21:38,185
I think it would be a mistake
to attack Wakanda.

1369
01:21:40,354 --> 01:21:41,772
(KIMOYO BEADS TRILL SOFTLY)

1370
01:21:44,983 --> 01:21:45,984
RAMONDA: (ON PHONE) Yes?

1371
01:21:46,068 --> 01:21:46,944
We have a problem.

1372
01:22:08,632 --> 01:22:10,968
Is my daughter alive?

1373
01:22:11,135 --> 01:22:13,095
The princess
is alive and well.

1374
01:22:13,804 --> 01:22:16,640
She requested
to be taken to Talokan.

1375
01:22:16,807 --> 01:22:19,184
She will remain there
for the time being.

1376
01:22:22,813 --> 01:22:26,066
What can I offer you
in exchange?

1377
01:22:26,483 --> 01:22:27,484
Nothing.

1378
01:22:27,943 --> 01:22:29,653
I beg to differ.

1379
01:22:29,820 --> 01:22:33,490
The Americans are preparing
to blame Wakanda

1380
01:22:33,574 --> 01:22:36,118
for your attack
on their mining ship.

1381
01:22:36,285 --> 01:22:39,246
Return my daughter
and the scientist

1382
01:22:39,413 --> 01:22:43,000
or I will inform them
of your existence.

1383
01:22:49,715 --> 01:22:51,842
If you tell the Americans
about us,

1384
01:22:53,343 --> 01:22:55,512
if you try to find us,

1385
01:22:56,597 --> 01:23:00,392
or if I discover a single
Wakandan ship in the ocean,

1386
01:23:01,185 --> 01:23:02,644
I will kill the princess.

1387
01:23:04,188 --> 01:23:05,981
I will come to Wakanda

1388
01:23:06,148 --> 01:23:08,108
and I will kill you.

1389
01:23:17,451 --> 01:23:18,494
So, what happened?

1390
01:23:20,370 --> 01:23:23,373
He wants to go to war
with the surface world,

1391
01:23:23,540 --> 01:23:25,334
and asked me to help him.

1392
01:23:29,838 --> 01:23:31,256
I need to think.

1393
01:23:32,132 --> 01:23:34,092
We ain't never
gettin' out of here.

1394
01:23:34,176 --> 01:23:36,178
(FAINT FOOTSTEPS)

1395
01:23:37,846 --> 01:23:39,806
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

1396
01:23:43,143 --> 01:23:44,144
Ey!

1397
01:23:44,228 --> 01:23:46,271
-(GUN CHARGING)
-(TENSE MUSIC PLAYS)

1398
01:23:46,396 --> 01:23:47,397
(IN MAYA)

1399
01:23:51,485 --> 01:23:52,986
(GUN CHARGING)

1400
01:24:04,873 --> 01:24:06,291
(BREATHING SHAKILY)

1401
01:24:07,543 --> 01:24:08,544
Shuri...

1402
01:24:09,461 --> 01:24:11,046
(IN XHOSA)

1403
01:24:11,755 --> 01:24:12,756
(GUARD GRUNTS)

1404
01:24:12,839 --> 01:24:14,216
(TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES)

1405
01:24:14,299 --> 01:24:15,592
(GROANING)

1406
01:24:15,676 --> 01:24:16,802
(IN ENGLISH) Are you okay?

1407
01:24:17,594 --> 01:24:18,971
Are you okay?

1408
01:24:19,221 --> 01:24:20,472
-Give me your Beads!
-Let's go.

1409
01:24:20,639 --> 01:24:22,015
Give me your Beads.
I can save her.

1410
01:24:22,099 --> 01:24:23,100
We have to go.

1411
01:24:23,267 --> 01:24:24,393
Shuri, I don't know
who this lady is,

1412
01:24:24,476 --> 01:24:25,561
but we need to listen to her.

1413
01:24:25,727 --> 01:24:26,895
Listen, I hit her
with a sonic round.

1414
01:24:27,062 --> 01:24:29,314
It is lethal from this distance.
There is no chance.

1415
01:24:29,398 --> 01:24:31,275
You don't understand.
This will mean war.

1416
01:24:31,441 --> 01:24:33,777
-We have to go.
-Wait!

1417
01:24:33,860 --> 01:24:35,737
(GASPING)

1418
01:24:36,780 --> 01:24:38,991
(TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES)

1419
01:24:52,462 --> 01:24:54,298
(ENGINE HUMMING)

1420
01:25:01,972 --> 01:25:03,640
(RAMONDA GASPING EMOTIONALLY)

1421
01:25:04,600 --> 01:25:06,643
(SOFT MUSIC PLAYING)

1422
01:25:17,404 --> 01:25:18,405
Did they hurt you?

1423
01:25:18,488 --> 01:25:20,115
No. No.

1424
01:25:21,658 --> 01:25:22,868
Thank you.

1425
01:25:23,619 --> 01:25:24,870
(IN XHOSA)

1426
01:25:26,371 --> 01:25:27,581
-GRIOT.
-GRIOT: (IN ENGLISH) Yes, my Queen.

1427
01:25:27,664 --> 01:25:29,708
Return us to Wakanda at once.

1428
01:25:33,545 --> 01:25:34,796
(IN MAYAN)

1429
01:25:57,778 --> 01:25:58,862
(EXHALES)

1430
01:26:02,240 --> 01:26:03,325
(NAMOR SIGHS)

1431
01:26:15,337 --> 01:26:17,506
(SORROWFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

1432
01:26:43,824 --> 01:26:45,909
(MUSIC BUILDING UP)

1433
01:26:48,870 --> 01:26:51,123
(FOREBODING MUSIC PLAYING)

1434
01:27:19,901 --> 01:27:21,486
(RUMBLING)

1435
01:27:23,697 --> 01:27:25,449
(TALOKANIL REPEATING)

1436
01:27:27,826 --> 01:27:29,411
(TALOKANIL REPEATING)

1437
01:27:33,039 --> 01:27:34,207
(ECHOING)

1438
01:28:14,664 --> 01:28:16,875
(TALOKANIL REPEATING CHANT)

1439
01:28:19,002 --> 01:28:20,420
(REPEATS CHANT)

1440
01:28:26,635 --> 01:28:29,054
MAN: (IN ENGLISH) Princess,
it is good to have you back.

1441
01:28:29,596 --> 01:28:31,389
The city has been on edge
since you left.

1442
01:28:32,307 --> 01:28:33,308
Go.

1443
01:28:33,475 --> 01:28:36,061
Fortify the sonic barriers
for all waterways.

1444
01:28:36,228 --> 01:28:37,229
Princess?

1445
01:28:38,146 --> 01:28:39,147
Neka.

1446
01:28:41,107 --> 01:28:43,485
Thank the ancestors. Hmm?

1447
01:28:43,819 --> 01:28:47,030
I just wanted to return these.

1448
01:28:48,240 --> 01:28:50,408
No. Keep them.

1449
01:28:50,575 --> 01:28:52,077
Might need them soon.

1450
01:28:52,994 --> 01:28:54,996
Did you get that
from down there?

1451
01:28:57,958 --> 01:29:01,336
Is it true you saw
an underwater empire?

1452
01:29:02,587 --> 01:29:04,339
-Yes.
-ANEKA: Hmm.

1453
01:29:05,006 --> 01:29:06,591
It is beautiful.

1454
01:29:07,843 --> 01:29:10,470
But these people
are dangerous, Aneka.

1455
01:29:10,971 --> 01:29:12,013
ANEKA: Mm.

1456
01:29:19,855 --> 01:29:21,982
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

1457
01:29:30,657 --> 01:29:33,451
RAMONDA: So,
Miss Riri Williams,

1458
01:29:34,202 --> 01:29:36,371
what do you think of Wakanda?

1459
01:29:36,538 --> 01:29:38,540
The stories just don't do
this place justice.

1460
01:29:38,623 --> 01:29:39,708
(RAMONDA CHUCKLES)

1461
01:29:41,668 --> 01:29:42,711
It's great.

1462
01:29:42,878 --> 01:29:44,629
But I really
would like to go home.

1463
01:29:46,089 --> 01:29:47,674
You will need to be patient.

1464
01:29:47,841 --> 01:29:49,885
Can I at least call my mom?

1465
01:29:50,552 --> 01:29:51,720
(INHALES SHARPLY)

1466
01:29:52,596 --> 01:29:54,097
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

1467
01:29:56,308 --> 01:29:57,726
SOLDIER: The Princess
has been brought home

1468
01:29:57,809 --> 01:29:59,603
by the War Dog Nakia.

1469
01:29:59,769 --> 01:30:01,146
Glory to Hanuman.

1470
01:30:01,229 --> 01:30:02,689
SOLDIERS: Glory to Hanuman.

1471
01:30:02,772 --> 01:30:07,319
Mm. The spy saves Wakanda
once again.

1472
01:30:07,903 --> 01:30:09,362
The Queen will reward her

1473
01:30:09,529 --> 01:30:12,032
with lifetime banishment.
I'm sure of it.

1474
01:30:12,115 --> 01:30:13,909
(ALL LAUGHING)

1475
01:30:14,492 --> 01:30:15,952
Okoye.

1476
01:30:18,413 --> 01:30:19,414
(IN XHOSA)

1477
01:30:21,583 --> 01:30:22,834
OKOYE: (IN ENGLISH)
After Thanos' attack,

1478
01:30:23,293 --> 01:30:25,420
when you left
without saying a word,

1479
01:30:26,046 --> 01:30:27,213
it hurt.

1480
01:30:31,176 --> 01:30:34,596
I regret not being there
with all of you.

1481
01:30:36,097 --> 01:30:37,390
It was not easy.

1482
01:30:38,183 --> 01:30:39,184
He was...

1483
01:30:39,851 --> 01:30:43,688
King and Black Panther
to everyone.

1484
01:30:44,356 --> 01:30:46,524
But to me... (BREATH SHUDDERS)

1485
01:30:46,608 --> 01:30:47,859
(SIGHS)

1486
01:30:52,280 --> 01:30:53,990
he was everything.

1487
01:30:55,867 --> 01:30:57,827
My T'Challa.

1488
01:30:59,162 --> 01:31:02,123
When he was taken away
from me, just like that, I...

1489
01:31:02,874 --> 01:31:04,751
I had to step away

1490
01:31:05,669 --> 01:31:07,295
and let myself break.

1491
01:31:09,965 --> 01:31:11,174
I couldn't just...

1492
01:31:12,133 --> 01:31:15,512
keep going as if nothing
had happened, you know.

1493
01:31:16,346 --> 01:31:18,306
OKOYE: Mm-hmm. (SIGHS)

1494
01:31:19,391 --> 01:31:21,393
(PEOPLE CLAMORING)

1495
01:31:33,321 --> 01:31:34,322
We are under attack.

1496
01:31:34,406 --> 01:31:35,949
-(EXPLOSION)
-(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

1497
01:31:37,826 --> 01:31:38,952
(EXPLOSION)

1498
01:31:40,996 --> 01:31:42,122
(TENSE MUSIC PLAYING)

1499
01:31:42,205 --> 01:31:43,289
Here.

1500
01:31:47,419 --> 01:31:49,045
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

1501
01:31:50,130 --> 01:31:51,131
(IN XHOSA)

1502
01:31:51,965 --> 01:31:53,633
(IN ENGLISH) Are you okay?
Are you all right?

1503
01:31:53,717 --> 01:31:55,593
GRIOT, activate the Sunbird.

1504
01:31:55,760 --> 01:31:56,928
Shuri, where are you?

1505
01:31:57,095 --> 01:31:58,555
Making my way
to the city right now.

1506
01:31:58,722 --> 01:32:00,181
Stand down! That is an order!

1507
01:32:00,348 --> 01:32:02,642
Mother, I'm with Aneka.
We can provide air support.

1508
01:32:02,809 --> 01:32:04,185
RAMONDA: (ON COMMS) Aneka,
do not let her leave the lab.

1509
01:32:04,269 --> 01:32:05,353
Mother, you're...
you're breaking up.

1510
01:32:05,437 --> 01:32:06,438
-We can't hear you.
-RAMONDA: Shuri!

1511
01:32:06,521 --> 01:32:07,522
Love you. Bye!

1512
01:32:07,605 --> 01:32:09,774
-(CALL DISCONNECTS)
-(RAMONDA GASPS)

1513
01:32:09,858 --> 01:32:10,942
You just hung up on the Queen.

1514
01:32:11,109 --> 01:32:12,110
I just hung up on my mom.

1515
01:32:12,277 --> 01:32:13,862
There's a difference.
Come. Let's go!

1516
01:32:19,159 --> 01:32:20,326
(MAN GRUNTS)

1517
01:32:21,619 --> 01:32:23,246
(BOTH PANTING)

1518
01:32:25,665 --> 01:32:27,542
(HIGH-PITCHED WHISTLE)

1519
01:32:29,252 --> 01:32:31,254
(TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES)

1520
01:32:31,713 --> 01:32:33,214
(ORCA CLICKING)

1521
01:32:37,552 --> 01:32:40,055
(TALOKANIL WOMEN
HARMONIZING MELODIOUSLY)

1522
01:32:46,102 --> 01:32:48,188
(LOUDLY) Invaders!

1523
01:32:53,777 --> 01:32:56,988
-(PANICKED CHATTER)
-Mama! Mama!

1524
01:32:57,072 --> 01:32:58,198
(SCREAMS)

1525
01:32:59,908 --> 01:33:00,992
(IN XHOSA)

1526
01:33:02,535 --> 01:33:05,330
(MELODIOUS HARMONIZING
CONTINUES)

1527
01:33:05,413 --> 01:33:06,414
GRIOT: (IN ENGLISH)
EMTs are suffering

1528
01:33:06,498 --> 01:33:08,291
a form of sonic hypnosis.

1529
